<title>USA: TABLE-J.P. Morgan Q2 net lower.</title>
<headline>TABLE-J.P. Morgan Q2 net lower.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.85		    $2.14</p>
<p> Net			374,000		  440,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 193,149		  202,064</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.89		    $4.28</p>
<p> Net			798,000		  879,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 200,751		  202,043</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Total revenues for Q2 1997 and Q2 1996 were $1.79 billion and $1.76 billion, respectively.</p>
<p>Per-share earnings are on both a fully diluted and primary basis, except for Q2 1997, when  fully diluted earnings were $1.84, and the first half of 1996, when fully diluted earnings were $4.27.</p>
</text>
